Its Antora content model and resource-ID resolution (component/version/module/
family lookup, xref/include/image target handling, completion and diagnostics)
are derived from the Antora support in the AsciiDoc plugin for IntelliJ,
reimplemented in Rust as a standalone language server:

  asciidoctor-intellij-plugin
  https://github.com/asciidoctor/asciidoctor-intellij-plugin
  Copyright (C) 2013-2020 Julien Viet, Erik Pragt, Alexander Schwartz
  and the individual contributors.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original: rewritten in Rust as an LSP server (tower-lsp);
IntelliJ PSI/indexing replaced by a filesystem scan of antora.yml and module
directories; editor integration moved to the Language Server Protocol.
